  "content": "<p>本模组为<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>JEI</strong></a>增添了新功能，允许玩家查看每个村民职业所需的工作站点方块。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>使用方法：在绿宝石或村民刷怪蛋上按下JEI的用途键（默认：U），即可显示所有村民职业的列表。若想了解某个职业由哪个模组添加，可按住Shift键，职业名称前会显示对应模组ID。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>如需寻找<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>REI</strong></a>的对应版本，请参阅<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-professions-rep\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Professions (REP)</a>。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz合作伙伴\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fakliz.net%252fmrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要服务器？使用促销代码\"mrbysco\"首月可享八折优惠。</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>如有疑问，欢迎加入我的Discord频道。</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord链接\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;<strong>想支持我们吗？</strong></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -Mrbysco</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shynieke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -ShyNieke</p>",
